cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "Buckling of a floating viscous layer: MSc analysis code"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code from an MSc thesis on the compression of a
  thin viscous layer floating on a liquid substrate in a rectangular geometry.
  An OpenCV pipeline extracts amplitude and curvature time series from video
  of the layer, and gnuplot scripts reproduce the thesis figures, including
  the thicken-to-buckle transition.
type: software
